# :store load reads each member name as its key, never a tag, and a null member loads no key (#2329).
> :clock virtual 2026-09-30T10:00:00Z
> :store load
| {"k":null,"j":1}
loaded 1 keys
> :store
"j" = 1
> :store load
| {"$map":7}
loaded 1 keys
> :store
"$map" = 7
> :store save out.json
wrote out.json
> 1 + 1
2
